# These are the public Supabase client config for the Sanadak project.
# They are safe to commit: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the
# client bundle at build time regardless, and the anon/publishable key
# is designed to be exposed to the browser (access is enforced by RLS,
# not by keeping this key secret).
#
# The app also uses a SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY server-side (the APK
# security-scan pipeline in src/lib/security/*) — that one is a real
# secret, is never committed here or anywhere in the repo, and is set
# only in the Vercel dashboard's Environment Variables.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://vypybcqihqpcaptjcoql.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_-qbQK1uw12OPHEq36ytj6Q_Y2lCBUiL
